    <title>Vol.02 当计划遇上“意外”的旅行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67238e0f33c798676f7a1427</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67238e0f33c798676f7a1427</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Oct 2024 14:10:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>写在前面 Intro</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>国庆长假“呼”的一下就这么过去了！大家都去哪里旅行了呢？说到旅行，里面的“意外”就实在是数不胜数了，相信你一定有——</span></p><span></span><p><span>很想吐槽的旅行经历！在旅行中和搭子闹掰！让人失望的目的地！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期的「错错得对」很特别，录制于三个国家、三个城市，我们邀请到了身边几位很会玩的朋友，他们对独自旅行颇有心得、非常擅长做旅行规划，或是能挖掘到意想不到的旅行目的地，甚至就是适合搭伙旅行的绝佳伙伴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不是每一次日出都很美丽，不是每一段旅程都会顺利。</span></p><span></span><p><span>旅途之间，丰富际遇，每一次都是向内的远行。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>那么，「错错得对」的第二期Vol.02，就从「出发」开始 ——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>“姐妹，我好像忘记带我的充电器。。。”</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>本期主播 Hosts</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>小黄，喜欢折腾的小黄</span></p><span></span><p><span>笑笑，喜欢看你折腾的笑笑</span></p><span></span><p><span>晃抠你，品牌策划，独立撰稿人 播客“话仙桃”主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>Yuman &amp; Ruwen，设计师品牌 “VOIMENT 吾们” 主创设计师 &amp; 合伙人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> 旅行“快问快答”，你是什么样的“旅行者”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a> &nbsp;避雷！辨别那些“made in 义乌”的旅行纪念品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> &nbsp;旅行后就BE ？那些我想吐槽的旅行搭子！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">16:29</a> &nbsp;一个人旅行也可以很美丽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a> &nbsp;不扫兴的川渝妈妈，我的最佳旅伴！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1686">28:06</a> &nbsp;非洲看动物大迁徙，来自爸妈最“疯狂”的提议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1762">29:22</a> &nbsp;City girl or country girl ? 选哪个做旅行目的地？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1917">31:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;在肯尼亚，飞机也会为了长颈鹿在天上多盘几圈！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2258">37:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;在中亚追觅咸海的魔幻之旅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuHq6fkLOwAV6SGJO80c3Ly02rg4.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljJSVFZbMfNM66e0rQ7HtrkcBoq4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2644">44:04</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;被犀牛追？谁能想到在奇特旺会有那么多难忘的意外！</span><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvaqYh5jQXgfsAb2zq9uNjp2-W7i.mp4"></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtV7VoRkcHNDqO5iQCzFzmxXemIq.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpefWBtmxSF4vJ4_gLqd9CXBmlen.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（其实这里是一段“长达”10s的搞笑追逐视频，小宇宙限制放不上来有点可惜哈哈）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2783">46:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;叮~~不同凡响的旅行目的地推荐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2793">46:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;中亚爱好者的推荐：吉尔吉斯斯坦的徒步之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;设计迷的最佳目的地：迷人的柏林地铁之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;打破舒适区，在街头为偶遇的陌生人拍片成就完美的马德里之行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3134">52:14</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;旅行激发我把每一天变得更满了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;旅行解锁了我太多的可能性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3289">54:49</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;旅行就是带点什么回来，丢点什么出去！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3331">55:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;碎叶城直观“生死”的经历 ，拓宽了我生命的宽度</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>特别感谢 Special thx to</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>再次感谢我们可爱的朋友们 晃抠你、Yuman &amp; Ruwen</span></p><span></span><p><span>Logo design | Jash</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music remix | inini</span></p>]]></description>
