    <title>Vol.01 我是如何“搞砸”一段关系的？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6719ba2fdb2cf827578abc0e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6719ba2fdb2cf827578abc0e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Oct 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>写在前面 Intro</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>或谨小慎微、或不以为然，我们的生活中有太多大大小小的“错误”了。但这又如何呢？我们都会“犯错”，有时正是那些频发的“风波”狙击了生命中难以抵抗的“骇浪”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「错错得对」是一个关心“错误”的播客，不要沉重、轻轻松松，一起聊聊我们遇到的那些“麻烦”。如果你刚好听到了这档播客，请你在每期节目的一开始暗自默念：</span></p><span></span><p><span>"It 's okay, we all make mistakes."</span></p><span></span><p><span>这就是冥冥之中，治愈的力量。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>本期主播 Hosts</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>小黄，喜欢折腾的小黄</span></p><span></span><p><span>笑笑，喜欢看你折腾的笑笑</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>那么，「错错得对」的创刊号Vol.01，就从两个好朋友乐此不疲的话题开始 ——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>“姐妹，我好像又要搞砸这段关系了。。。”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>⭐️本期高光时刻</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a></span></strong><span> 小黄和笑笑，三十岁之后“捡来”的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a></span></strong><span> 所谓“错错得对”，就是去轻松谈论那些生活里的大小“错误”吧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;一段无疾而终的伦敦爱情</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="481">08:01</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;如同《诺丁山》一般的梦幻开场</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;去爱上一个具体的人，还是爱情美好的模样？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;恋爱的人 爱全世界 我想我对这个世界有“恋爱脑”！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">22:43</a></span></strong><span> 对方是个迷人而危险的角色，我还是“将错就错”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1762">29:22</a></span></strong><span> 是时候为一段“错误百出”的浪漫爱情画上句话</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2001">33:21</a></span></strong><span> 每次的力挽狂澜，都在证明“我可以”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2119">35:19</a></span></strong><span> 亲密关系如同镜子，折射出了我与自己的关系</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2253">37:33</a></span></strong><span> 为了挽回一段爱情，我能有多“疯”呢？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2416">40:16</a></span></strong><span> 有爱“忠告”，也是祝福：你只需要做自己，便值得被人爱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2576">42:56</a></span></strong><span> 尽情享受当下吧，即使搞砸了也没关系</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2662">44:22</a></span></strong><span> 谢谢聆听！也请告诉我们你在亲密关系里犯过的那些错吧</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>特别感谢 Special thx to</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Logo design | Jash</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music remix | inini</span></p>]]></description>
